hub.description:
{status}

Log in to 10s (→) with the registration token 10s gave you, then link the metered devices under it. **✓ Check and save** creates the integration once you are logged in.

The login is kept on this Home Assistant as soon as 10s accepts it, so closing this window before you save does not lose it: the next setup opens logged in.

devices.description:
The meters whose energy 10s collects — as many as you like. Devices are monitored only: 10s reads their meters and never controls them.

